    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:1da32b650cc5e0ba",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7c42dbf4da940b165a887f48735f0df4eeca0f0451cb61b34434a046182436af",
      "text": "In addition, Lima is considered the gastronomic capital of Latin America. Here are the best restaurants not only on the continent, but also in the world!\n\nRecommended restaurants:\n\nCentral Restaurante (Peruvian cuisine) Reservation is required!\n\nMaido (Peruvian cuisine, seafood)\n\nRafael (Peruvian cuisine, seafood)\n\nLa Mar (Peruvian cuisine, seafood)\n\nAstrid y Gaston (Peruvian cuisine, seafood)",
